ckout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence\",\n+        \"hash\": \"104edacde2f7\",\n+        \"state\": \"active\"\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"id\": \"R2\",\n+        \"kind\": \"requirement\",\n+        \"namespace\": \"spec:pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence\",\n+        \"hash\": \"5a4d872e5759\",\n+        \"state\": \"active\"\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"id\": \"D1\",\n+        \"kind\": \"decision\",\n+        \"namespace\": \"spec:pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence\",\n+        \"hash\": \"8696c717b61e\",\n+        \"state\": \"active\",\n+        \"relations\": [\n+          \"R1\",\n+          \"R2\"\n+        ]\n+      }\n+    ],\n+    \"digest\": \"sha256:e51d49bfd7dafeabedd08a05e1652a17327dec95153043a0b32967cc8a622b62\"\n+  },\n+  \"phase\": \"started\",\n+  \"recorded_at\": \"2026-11-10T17:13:34Z\"\n+}\ndiff --git a/pose-mcp/internal/pose/checkout_blockers_child_evidence_test.go b/pose-mcp/internal/pose/checkout_blockers_child_evidence_test.go\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 00000000..3fd16682\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/pose-mcp/internal/pose/checkout_blockers_child_evidence_test.go\n@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@\n+package pose\n+\n+import \"testing\"\n+\n+// Spec pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence.\n+\n+// R1: a sealed checkout is not blocked by the missing review bundles of the children of its scope\n+// (evidence newer than the subject's head), and still is by every other blocker.\n+func TestTheSealedCheckoutIsNotBlockedByChildEvidenceItCannotHold(t *testing.T) {\n+\tblockers := []string{\n+\t\t\"delivery integrity is unavailable: no generation\",\n+\t\t\"child milestone:pose-shared-runtime/optional-worktree-runtime has no sealed review bundle: current semantic inputs are not represented by a sealed bundle\",\n+\t\t\"child milestone:pose-shared-runtime/bounded-graph-caches has no sealed review bundle\",\n+\t\t\"review policy is not adopted\",\n+\t\t\"the roadmap names a milestone no spec belongs to\",\n+\t\t\"children of the scope are not terminal\",\n+\t}\n+\tgot := checkoutBlockers(blockers)\n+\twant := []string{\"review policy is not adopted\", \"the roadmap names a milestone no spec belongs to\", \"children of the scope are not terminal\"}\n+\tif len(got) != len(want) {\n+\t\tt.Fatalf(\"checkoutBlockers = %q, want %q\", got, want)\n+\t}\n+\tfor i := range want {\n+\t\tif got[i] != want[i] {\n+\t\t\tt.Fatalf(\"checkoutBlockers[%d] = %q, want %q\", i, got[i], want[i])\n+\t\t}\n+\t}\n+}\ndiff --git a/pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_dispatch.go b/pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_dispatch.go\nindex ac001779..1aea9f95 100644\n--- a/pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_dispatch.go\n+++ b/pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_dispatch.go\n@@ -1693,16 +1693,30 @@ func sealedInputsThatDiffer(sealed, other ReviewBundle, checkout string) []strin\n \treturn differing\n }\n \n+// checkoutBlockers are the blockers of the sealed checkout that hold there. Two kinds do not,\n+// because they concern evidence that is not part of the sealed subject and that a checkout of\n+// the sealed commit cannot hold: the delivery integrity index (derived, not checked out) and the\n+// sealed review bundles of the children of a roadmap or milestone. The children are reviewed and\n+// committed before the roadmap bundle is sealed, but the subject's head is the last commit that\n+// changed a subject path, which is older than their records; the bundle sealed at the real head\n+// already judged them, and closing the scope judges them again (spec\n+// pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence).\n func checkoutBlockers(blockers []string) []string {\n \tvar out []string\n \tfor _, blocker := range blockers {\n-\t\tif !strings.Contains(blocker, \"delivery integrity is unavailable\") {\n-\t\t\tout = append(out, blocker)\n+\t\tif strings.Contains(blocker, \"delivery integrity is unavailable\") || isChildReviewEvidenceBlocker(blocker) {\n+\t\t\tcontinue\n \t\t}\n+\t\tout = append(out, blocker)\n \t}\n \treturn out\n }\n \n+// isChildReviewEvidenceBlocker recognises \"child <scope> has no sealed review bundle[: why]\".\n+func isChildReviewEvidenceBlocker(blocker string) bool {\n+\treturn strings.HasPrefix(blocker, \"child \") && strings.Contains(blocker, \" has no sealed review bundle\")\n+}\n+\n func sourceMaterializationDiffers(root, commit string, entries []ReviewBundleSubjectEntry) string {\n \tif commit == \"\" || !hasGitMetadata(root) {\n \t\t// No sealed commit, or no repository at all: nothing to compare with (a dispatch has both).\n6fbed268 chore: record strict validation after final closeout pass\ne41149a3 chore: start the sealed checkout child evidence spec\n394849f5 fix: the sealed checkout is not blocked by child review evidence it cannot hold","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"4ec705c0-6af1-4aca-bcc4-5111ebfac2aa","timestamp":"2026-11-10T17:25:40.891Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"diff --git a/.pose/changelogs/unreleased/pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence.md b/.pose/changelogs/unreleased/pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 00000000..7acc7c05\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.pose/changelogs/unreleased/pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@\n+---\n+spec: pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence\n+category: fixed\n+breaking: false\n+---\n+A revisão delegada de um roadmap (ou de um milestone com filhos) deixa de falhar com \"sealed checkout blocked: child … has no sealed review bundle\": o checkout selado não contém a evidência de review dos filhos, que é commitada depois do último commit do sujeito, e o selamento e o fechamento já a julgam.\ndiff --git a/.pose/starts/pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence.json b/.pose/starts/pose-sealed-checkout-does-not-require-later-child-evidence.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 00000000..302dccba\n--- /de